{#- Guidance Layer -#}
Please output only the claims extraction guide, where each item is an executable judgment rule for the subsequent extractor.

## Output Field Description
- `extraction_guidance`: Extraction guidance list, each item being an executable judgment rule pointing to attention areas across dimensions such as state, relationship, commitment, and knowledge.
- Every item must be a short string, never an object, plot recap, or character biography.
- Use role labels such as protagonist, informed character, or relationship parties. Do not include concrete character names; downstream Claims must copy names from their current source chunk.

